From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:38:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ini: Read OSGeo4W setup.ini names without signatures, take
 the mirror list from OSGEO4W_MIRROR_URL and parse license lines


diff --git a/IniDBBuilder.h b/IniDBBuilder.h
index 3b89041..ce05696 100644
